STEP 13 \'97 OVERALL NOTE STATUS\
--------------------------------------------------\
\
Mechanical and AI outcomes remain separate.\
\
A note can have:\
\
- clone.status = POSSIBLE_DUPLICATE\
- review.decision = PASS\
\
That note must remain visible for human duplicate comparison even though the AI passed it.\
\
A note can also have:\
\
- clone.status = POSSIBLE_DUPLICATE\
- review.decision = REOPEN_TO_PEER\
\
Both findings must be shown.\
\
Suggested composite queue logic:\
\
Needs human attention when any of these are true:\
\
- Mechanical failure\
- Possible duplicate\
- AI decision is not PASS\
- AI_REVIEW_ERROR\
- Existing manual flag\
\
Do not convert a possible duplicate directly into an AI failure.\
\
Do not automatically reopen a note solely because the mechanical system found a possible duplicate. The human reviewer should compare the notes and determine whether it represents inappropriate copying.\
